      "source_text": "那也是理所当然的。\n海塞克可是无论男女老少都欢迎的\n现役超级偶像……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a71cb1d518a995b01596bfaa65b4193e1af61a776fbe16f56b77742314807a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
