      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她发布的每首歌都成为了广告主题曲，\n登上封面的杂志都卖得飞快……\n最近巨蛋巡演也大获成功。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6776fde5409a9f45119a28ac0d4fac48b9de7b83c4bba6c1338045075802efc0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
