      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "URA所属的速度象征，\n凭借自己的经验和扎实的知识，\n给赛马娘们提供了清晰的建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42d282e55bcafbe2dad528b562c199c6b853557fe12a18a257955a7e6eb5ef36",
